--protocol seen names three tier-M arms (seen_simple, seen_cyl, seen_aug) under
ckpt/exp07/<arm>/; command() appends --protocol seen plus the arm's yaw flags,
check_golden ties the arm root to backbone/yaw/protocol against the new goldens
(a seen argv under an exp_04/exp_05 root and an unseen argv under ckpt/exp07 are
both refused), and full asserts train_batches_per_epoch == 9265 for seen (9261
stays the unseen requirement). compare_control defaults the protocol of a
historical comparator to 'unseen', which also repairs the five exp_05 launcher
tests that round 1 turned red by adding the field to effective_args.

Goldens: argv_golden_seen_{simple,cyl,aug}{,_smoke}.txt = plan §2 recipe +
--protocol seen + the arm flags; the smoke variants carry the exp_04 smoke recipe
so cycle 3 can dry-run a seen smoke through the launcher.

